==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
This stage isn't overly difficult due to the constant stream of Mooths that provide the player with all the cash they need. THE SLOTH is quite slow so use meatshields to stall it in place while you attack it with rushers such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. If rushing isn't an option, you can use [[:Category:Tanker-class Cats|tankers]] such as [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] instead to brute force your way through. Trolly Bloggers can be irritating so spammable attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] should be of use.

